stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Understand
    Understand: understand question<br/>entities · intent · answer type
    Understand --> Decompose
    Decompose: sub-questions<br/>each with a completion condition
    Decompose --> Search

    Search: search<br/>keyword + vector + graph
    Search --> Extract
    Extract: extract entities · claims · relations
    Extract --> Expand
    Expand: expand graph<br/>to connected facts
    Expand --> Assess

    Assess: which sub-questions<br/>still lack evidence?
    Assess --> Plan: gaps remain, budget left
    Assess --> Verify: all supported
    Assess --> Verify: no new evidence<br/>for 2 rounds
    Assess --> Verify: budget exhausted<br/>(answer marked partial)

    Plan: plan next query<br/>from what was learned
    Plan --> Search

    Verify: verify support<br/>classify claims · detect conflicts
    Verify --> Answer
    Answer: grounded answer<br/>evidence chain · citations ·<br/>confidence · stop reason
    Answer --> [*]
